+## 5. Findings
+
+### Blocking
+
+**B1 — Required review inputs were not supplied; four questions are unverifiable.**
+No PR #90 metadata, no head SHA, no patch digest, and no diff of any kind. Q1 (in full), Q6, Q7, and Q8
